      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Gerard insisted on visiting us before doing our quote.  He was the actual installer so he needed to make sure about our home.  He arrived on time, provided practical information and answered all our questions.  When the time for the installation came, he and his team all arrived as scheduled.  They work quickly and efficiently.  It was all completed by mid-afternoon.  Because the installation happened just before Christmas, we couldn't get inspected for about 10 days When that happened, I couldn't see any energy production on the app.  I messaged Gerard and he quickly phoned me and walked me through a check to see what was wrong - the inspector left the inverter switched off.  Once it started, it's been great.  Joanne in the office has followed up providing all the completed certificates and documents for the installation.  She has also liaised with our power supplier to set up our grid feed-in.  Now we're just waiting for that to be confirmed.  All in all, our dealings with Schumacher Solar have been a positive experience, we have no hesitation in recommending them.",
