      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The quoting process was very easy and several options were discussed and quoted upon after a site/home visit. Would highly recommend having an inspection as this helped us decide on best panel positioning and layout on our roof. Our discussion was directly with the owner and installer (not through a sales person) who gave us confidence and reassurance of our choice of provider.The installation was arranged at a mutually agreed time and date and a crew of 4 arrived at the said time with all the gear and was installed in about 6-7 hours. Everyone was very polite, they worked safely and totally cleaned up after themselves.They arranged for the required safety inspection (within 4 working days) and are organising the grid connection; the process was simple and straight forward.Highly recommend Schumarcher Solar & Electrical.",
